	skos:definition "One edition of the framework, as the facts FINOS's front matter and data files state." ;
	skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ai-governance-framework> ;
	skos:note "The bodies of the risk, mitigation and use case pages stay in FINOS's files, which source_file names. The catalogue names each reference file's entries by key and leaves their titles there." .
